    {
      "selector": "#app-experience",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2927,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 730,
      "heading": "How Tennis Players Use SPARC",
      "backgroundColor": "#0C0C0C",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Download on App Store",
        "Get it on Google Play"
      ],
      "text": "APP EXPERIENCE How Tennis Players Use SPARC Players use SPARC daily to build mental performance habits, reflect on their game, and prepare to compete under pressure. Journaling & Match Logs Structured reflection tools to build mental habits and improve match outcomes. AI Insights & Tracking Personalized performance analysis after every match and training session. Sport-Specific Mental Training Science-based lessons built by licensed sport psychologists. Download on App Store Get it on Google Play",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69cab65125ea7dacf0680b53/69cab65125ea7dacf0680cf6_sparc-screen.webp"
      ],
      "assets": [
        "assets/how-tennis-players-use-sparc.webp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#testimonials",
      "type": "testimonials",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3657,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 947,
      "heading": "What Coaches & Athletes Are Saying",
      "backgroundColor": "#0C0C0C",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "What Coaches & Athletes Are Saying “Coming from USC to the professional circuit in 2026 was a big change. I found it challenging moving from the college system to the pro tour, but using SPARC gave me a daily system where I could continually evaluate myself mentally. It allowed me to analyse my mental game after close matches and therefore meant I was training my mental part of the game more regularly. Also the journaling part of SPARC helped me prepare before matches and consistently evaluate myself with a daily check in. I’ve only been on the pro circuit from January but can feel that SPARC ",
      "layout": "grid",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69cab65125ea7dacf0680b53/69cab65125ea7dacf0680cd0_oscar%20weightman.webp",
        "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69cab65125ea7dacf0680b53/69cab65125ea7dacf0680c9c_sc.webp",
